<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="c47df790">&lt;p&gt;
    The Communications Plan allows a management team to understand communication requirements, how to structure messages
    and information to appropriate stakeholders through the most effective channels and involve the right people to deliver
    communications at the most opportune time.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    The Communications Plan describes:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Communication needs and expectations associated with the business solution
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        What and how information will be communicated
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        When and where each communication will be delivered
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Who is responsible for developing and reviewing each type of communication
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="3e2807c"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="6dcbc487"></attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="d9e0317e"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="f7be55e3">&lt;p&gt;
    To define work activity, resources, work products and deliverables needed to execute the Communications Approach with
    the aim to structure communications that drive awareness and adoption by target audience. The plan is used as a
    reference and refreshed throughout the program lifecycle.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="impactOfNotHaving" nodeId="d752e4d1"></attribute>
<attribute name="reasonsForNotNeeding" nodeId="5e364675"></attribute>
<attribute name="briefOutline" nodeId="6ebac948">&lt;p&gt;
    The communications plan typically consists of:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Communications plan purpose
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Communications scope
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Communications objectives
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Communications approach
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Target audience, stakeholders 
        &lt;ol&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Communications topics
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Tools and techniques
            &lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;/ol&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Implementation approach 
        &lt;ol&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Alignment with business objectives
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Key considerations
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Deployment options
            &lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;/ol&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Communications rollout 
        &lt;ol&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Awareness
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Engagement
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Readiness/Training
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Deployment/Adoption
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Transition to business operations
            &lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;/ol&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Timing 
        &lt;ol&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Communications calendar
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Communications activities project plan
            &lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;/ol&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;</attribute>
